  "title": "Homemade Pita Bread",
  "description": "This pita bread recipe is simple to make and turns out fluffy and delicious pitas every time. There&#39;s nothing more delicious than homemade pita bread!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2013-05-10T16:41:23-04:00",
